  "root_problem": "Billing dispute tickets have roughly doubled since August, from ~600/month (Jun-Jul 2026) to ~1,180-1,260/month (Aug-Sep 2026) per crm-tickets dispute_volume_monthly (E-05). The dominant mechanism is a defect in billing import validation rather than estimate substitution or slow ticket handling: 59% of disputed bills carried an ACTUAL meter read vs 41% ESTIMATED (E-01), response times remain within the 3.0-day SLA (E-02), and no tariff change occurred (E-04) — consistent with H-RULE-CHANGE-DEFECT producing wrong bills even on accounts with a validly recorded actual read."
